WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,600
I tell you, from now on, you dare to hurt a hair on your own

2
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:08,200
I will send you to repair immediately so that you will not be alone in prison.

3
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:14,700
The Pei Zijun you met today came here specially to pray for me.

4
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:18,100
He never told you before because he wasn't completely sure either.

5
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:20,100
I'm afraid I'll give you an empty joy

6
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:24,220
So, during those few days and nights, you didn’t go back to your room.

7
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:27,340
It's all, let him take care of it for you

8
00:00:27,340 --> 00:00:39,990
Last night the bamboo fire in the hall swayed for most of an hour
